<title>TAJIKISTAN: SOCCER-TAJIKISTAN BEAT VIETNAM 4-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TAJIKISTAN BEAT VIETNAM 4-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>DUSHANBE 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tajikistan beat Vietnam 4-0</p>
<p>(halftime 2-0) in a World Cup Asian zone group eight qualifier</p>
<p>on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers - Umed Alidodov 8, Tokhirdzhon Muminov 16 (pen),</p>
<p>Shukhrad Dzhaborov 51, 82.</p>
<p>Attendance: 10,000</p>
</text>
